Really?

20:54.870 --> 20:55.850
I'm so glad!

20:55.850 --> 20:58.840
Hey, why are you crying? Get yourself together!

20:58.840 --> 21:02.020
You can cry after we become the champions tomorrow!

21:02.020 --> 21:04.190
I'm not crying!

21:04.190 --> 21:07.460
It's only sweat, sweat! Damn it!

21:07.460 --> 21:11.060
