Roberto, I want to take Tsubasa to Argentina.

21:41.490 --> 21:42.200
Eh?

21:42.200 --> 21:44.350
After the final tomorrow,

21:44.350 --> 21:48.580
I plan to submit a formal request to Japan's soccer association.

21:53.400 --> 21:56.440
Thank you, everyone!

